        {
          "tag": "a",
          "content": "Book Club Set (10 books + 1 DVD + 1 large print copy) - Rivalry between rich and poor gangs in 1960s Oklahoma leads to the deaths of three teenagers and intense soul-searching for one of the kids involved, a sensitive fourteen-year-old writer named Ponyboy. Large print has been proven to aid with fluency, decoding, and comprehension; this set includes one large print copy to share with struggling readers or those who prefer a larger type face. Also included is the film The Outsiders from 1984. For curricular resources on The Outsiders, please copy and paste this link from TeachingBooks.net into your internet browser: http://www.teachingbooks.net/tb.cgi?tid=5221"
